  "item_short_desc": "<p>Stay cool, dry, and comfortable while on the job with Rothco's Long Sleeve Tactical Performance Polo. Made from 100% polyester, this high-performance shirt features moisture-wicking properties that effectively pull sweat away from your skin, keeping you dry throughout the day. Designed with practicality in mind, the polo includes 2 mic clips on each shoulder and 1 under the center placket, making it easy to clip on mics and other communication accessories.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "103",
  "description": "<p>Stay cool, dry, and comfortable while on the job with Rothco's Long Sleeve Tactical Performance Polo. Made from 100% polyester, this high-performance shirt features moisture-wicking properties that effectively pull sweat away from your skin, keeping you dry throughout the day. Designed with practicality in mind, the polo includes 2 mic clips on each shoulder and 1 under the center placket, making it easy to clip on mics and other communication accessories. 2 pen pockets on the left sleeve offer convenient access to writing tools, even when wearing a tactical vest. The long sleeves provide additional protection against cooler weather and the elements, making this uniform polo ideal for a variety of work environments. Whether you're in the field or at the office, Rothco's Tactical Performance Polo combines functionality with comfort, ensuring you're ready for anything.</p>",
